WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
[soft, distant cello]

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.000
These trees... have seen everything.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.500
[the cello comes closer]

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.700
Some things... cannot be rushed.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.400
A thousand years... in a single drop.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.900
Elef. Olive oil from the Galilee.
